# Current paper recipe on NablaEngine, with the same residual actions and full workload.
# A reset starts a new contribution within the window, with its own discount and
# detached reset state. EMA updates once after all eight regression minibatches;
# its first beta uses n=0. Training always uses the live actor. Fresh runs only.
@base/action_target.args
--policy-ema --lr-warmup-steps 100
--physics engine --residual-action
--hours 3
